{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "edition_id": "WEBSTER1833",
  "book_code": "1TH",
  "chapter": 4,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "1TH.4.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1TH.4.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Furthermore then we beseech you, brethren, and exhort ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "you",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " by the Lord Jesus, that as ye have received from us how ye ought to walk and to please God, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "so",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " ye would abound more and more.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "1TH.4.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1TH.4.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For ye know what commandments we gave you by the Lord Jesus.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1TH.4.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1TH.4.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For this is the will of God, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "even",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " your sanctification, that ye should abstain from lewdness.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1TH.4.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1TH.4.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "That every one of you should know how to possess his vessel in sanctification and honor;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1TH.4.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1TH.4.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Not in the lust of concupiscence, even as the Gentiles who know not God:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1TH.4.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1TH.4.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "That no ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "man",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " go beyond and defraud his brother in ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "any",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " matter: because the Lord ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the avenger of all such, as we also have forewarned you and testified.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1TH.4.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1TH.4.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For God hath not called us to uncleanness, but to holiness.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1TH.4.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1TH.4.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He therefore that despiseth, despiseth not man, but God, who hath also given to us his holy Spirit.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1TH.4.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1TH.4.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But concerning brotherly love ye need not that I write to you: for ye yourselves are taught by God to love one another.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1TH.4.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1TH.4.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And indeed ye do it towards all the brethren who are in all Macedonia: but we beseech you, brethren, that ye increase more and more;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1TH.4.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1TH.4.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And that ye study to be quiet, and to do your own business, and to work with your own hands, as we commanded you;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1TH.4.12",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1TH.4.12",
      "verse": 12,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "That ye may walk honestly towards them that are without, and ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "that",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " ye may have need of nothing.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1TH.4.13",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1TH.4.13",
      "verse": 13,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But I would not have you to be ignorant, brethren, concerning them who are asleep, that ye sorrow not, even as others who have no hope.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1TH.4.14",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1TH.4.14",
      "verse": 14,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For if we believe that Jesus died and rose again, even so them also who sleep in Jesus will God bring with him.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1TH.4.15",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1TH.4.15",
      "verse": 15,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For this we say to you by the word of the Lord, that we who are alive ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "and",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " remain to the coming of the Lord shall not precede them who are asleep.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1TH.4.16",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1TH.4.16",
      "verse": 16,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For the Lord himself will descend from heaven with a shout, with the voice of an archangel, and with the trumpet of God: and the dead in Christ shall rise first:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1TH.4.17",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1TH.4.17",
      "verse": 17,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Then we who are alive ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "and",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " remain shall be caught up together with them in the clouds, to meet the Lord in the air: and so shall we ever be with the Lord.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1TH.4.18",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1TH.4.18",
      "verse": 18,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Wherefore, comfort one another with these words.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    }
  ]
}
